 ## Background
 The Adaptive Point Insertion Strategy is described in the context of Power Diagram Enhanced Adaptive Isosurface Extraction from Signed Distance Fields [S1]. It is used to improve the reconstruction of surface cavities and high-genus models, addressing failures of methods like RFTA to capture intricate details [S1].
